+JUST THE LOCAL SERVER (simplest)
+--------------------------------
+  KWALIFY-START.bat   Start the Kwalify server on this PC (http://localhost:<PORT>)
+  KWALIFY-STOP.bat    Stop it gracefully (does not touch PostgreSQL)
+
+  Uses your existing .env. PostgreSQL must already be running.
+  Does not start the Cloudflare tunnel (public kwalify.net) - use start.bat for that.
+
